#: src/admin/pages/dashboard/pages/header.js:252
#: src/admin/pages/dashboard/pages/sidebar.js:229
msgid "What is the separation element?"
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/pages/dashboard/pages/header.js:257
msgid "The separation element serves as the focal point from which other elements diverge, creating a distinct visual separation to the right and left. Rather than acting as a center element, it functions as the origin of the layout, determining the arrangement of elements for an organized and visually appealing Frontend dashboard."
msgstr ""

