#: src/admin/pages/dashboard/pages/sidebar.js:217
msgid "What is sidebar content?"
msgstr ""

#: src/admin/pages/dashboard/pages/sidebar.js:222
msgid "Sidebar content is prominently displayed at the side of the Frontend dashboard, serving as a focal point for your dashboard's visual presentation. You have the flexibility to incorporate all available elements into the sidebar content, giving you the ability to enable, disable, and seamlessly sort these elements according to your preferences. This feature empowers you to create a personalized and visually engaging dashboard sidebar tailored to your specific needs."
